.TH MYCAT 3 "September 2026" "Version 0.3.1" "MyUtils Library Manual"
.SH NAME
mycat \- display the contents of a file to stdout
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include <myfilefunctions.h>
.sp
.BI "int mycat(const char *" filename ");"
.SH DESCRIPTION
The
.B mycat()
function opens the file specified by
.I filename
and outputs its entire content to standard output (stdout).
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns 0 on success, or -1 if the file cannot be opened or read.
